WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:05.271
- MEN, AS WE LAUNCH
THE COUNTERATTACK

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.373
AGAINST THE UNION ARMY,
WE MUST REMEMBER

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.242 line:92%
THAT EVEN THOUGH WE MAY DIE

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.477
A GLORIOUS DEATH
ON THE BATTLEFIELD,

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.680
WE DO SO TO PRESERVE
A WAY OF LIFE.

00:00:14.713 --> 00:00:17.683 line:92%
THE SOUTHERN WAY OF LIFE.

00:00:17.716 --> 00:00:20.820
A WAY OF LIFE
SO PURE AND BEAUTIFUL

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:24.090
THAT NO MAN NOR GOVERNMENT
CAN TAKE THIS AWAY FROM US.

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:28.761 line:92%
THE RIGHT...

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:32.265 line:92%
THE RIGHT TO PRESERVE.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:33.766 line:92%
OUR OWN SO--

00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:36.602 line:92%
TO--

00:00:36.635 --> 00:00:38.504
WE A--
OH, [bleep].

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:41.474
- WELL, HELLO THERE, MASSA.
SORRY WE LATE.

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:45.178
- SHORE DIDN'T MEAN
TO SNEAK UP ON YA, SIR.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.346
- LOOK, FELLAS,
WE'RE TRYING TO HAVE

00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:48.648
A NICE, LITTLE CIVIL WAR
REENACTMENT HERE.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:49.816 line:92%
WE DON'T WANT ANY TROUBLE.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.085 line:92%
- SO ARE WE, SIR.

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:54.787
WE--WE--WE TRYING TO HAVE
A REAL NICE REENACTMENT.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.257
WE CERTAINLY DON'T WANNA CAUSE
ANY TROUBLE EITHER.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.459 line:92%
DO WE, SAM?

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:02.195 line:92%
- YOU ALWAYS TAUGHT US

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:07.200
TROUBLE ONLY COMES TO THOSE
WHO GONE DONE LOOKIN' FOR IT.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.534
- SO DON'T STOP YOUR SPEECHIN'
ON OUR ACCOUNT.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.803 line:92%
[giggles]

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:14.373
- AS JEFFERSON DA--OKAY, I KNOW
WHAT YOU'RE DOING. I GET IT.

00:01:14.406 --> 00:01:17.176 line:92%
- WHAT WE DOIN', SIR?

00:01:17.209 --> 00:01:18.878
I DON'T KNOW
WHAT YOU TALKIN' 'BOUT.

00:01:18.911 --> 00:01:21.380
DO YOU KNOW
WHAT HE TALKIN' 'BOUT, SAM?

00:01:21.413 --> 00:01:24.817
- WHY, WE JUST HERE
TO SLAVE ON ABOUT,

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.353
ANY OLE WHICH WAY
YOU WANT US TO.

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:30.490
- HOW MANY TIMES
DO I HAVE TO TELL PEOPLE,

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:32.225
JUST BECAUSE WE'RE DRESSED
LIKE CONFEDERATE SOLDIERS

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.559
DOESN'T MEAN
WE'RE PRO SLAVERY?

00:01:33.592 --> 00:01:35.695 line:92%
WE'RE JUST HERE TO PRESERVE

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.431
THE PURE AND BEAUTIFUL SLICE
OF SOUTHERN HISTORY.

00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:42.135
- YEAH, PURE AND BEAUTIFUL...
SLICE.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:45.471
- OH, LORDY, LORDY, LORDY!
WE SORRY, BOSS!

00:01:45.504 --> 00:01:47.874 line:92%
OH, WE SO SORRY!

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:51.210
- PLEASE DON'T
GIVE US THE WHIP.

00:01:51.243 --> 00:01:52.445
- OKAY, NOBODY'S GONNA WHIP
ANYBODY, JUST STOP IT.

00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:54.413 line:92%
- YEAH, JUST STOP IT.

00:01:54.446 --> 00:01:55.448
- ALL RIGHT, FELLAS, JUST--
JUST IGNORE 'EM.

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:57.383 line:92%
ALL RIGHT?

00:01:57.416 --> 00:01:59.585
NOW, WE'RE HERE
TO PRESERVE OUR WAY OF LIFE.

00:01:59.618 --> 00:02:01.687
THE SOUTH HAS A RIGHT TO OWN--
both: ♪ OH, MY LORD, LORD ♪

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.924
- THE SOUTH
HAS A WAY OF LIFE--

00:02:04.957 --> 00:02:07.260
both: ♪ OH, MY LORD ♪
- THE UNION CANNOT STOP US FR--

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.896 line:92%
both: ♪ OH, MY LORD, LORD ♪

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:12.265 line:92%
♪ OH, MY LORD... ♪

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:13.199
- THE UNION YANKEE BASTARDS
CANNOT STOP US--

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:15.168 line:92%
- ♪ OH, LORD! ♪

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.236
- ALL RIGHT, STOP IT!
STOP IT! THAT'S ENOUGH!

00:02:17.269 --> 00:02:18.671
YOU WANNA BE PART OF THIS
REENACTMENT?

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:20.806
FINE.
YOU'RE PART OF IT.

00:02:20.839 --> 00:02:22.875
GO--GO FETCH US SOME MUNITIONS
AND EVERYTHING ELSE THAT--

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:25.378
DON'T JUST STAND THERE
LIKE A BUNCH OF LAZY [bleep].

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:28.247
- THAT GOOD ENOUGH FOR YOU?
- THAT IS ALL I NEEDED TO HEAR.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.283
- GENTLEMEN,
GIVE US YOUR CASH

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.617
AND ANYTHING THAT IS
AN ACTUAL COLLECTOR'S ITEM.

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:33.553 line:92%
- YOU RACIST MOTHER[bleep].

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.788
- OKAY.
DON'T HAVE ALL DAY, MAN.

00:02:35.821 --> 00:02:38.291
OKAY, THANK YOU.
THANK YOU.

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.425
WALLETS, WALLETS,
WALLETS, WALLETS.

00:02:39.458 --> 00:02:41.227 line:92%
- THAT'S A VERY NICE PIECE.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.326 line:92%
THESE ARE HEAVY.

